---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About | WellRoost"
	description="Learn the mission, data frameworks, and decision thesis behind WellRoost."
>
	<link slot="head" rel="canonical" href={new URL('/about/', Astro.site).toString()} />

	<section class="pt-20 sm:pt-28">
		<p class="section-eyebrow">About WellRoost</p>
		<h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-1000">
			The Decision Engine for Your Home
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
			WellRoost was built on a simple premise: homeownership decisions shouldn't rely on guesswork or contractor sales pitches. We provide the analytical frameworks, calculators, and objective models to help you make high-ROI choices for your property.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
			<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Our Philosophy</p>
			<h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-1000">Numbers Before Hammers</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
				Whether you are evaluating a $60,000 kitchen remodel, considering a heat pump conversion, or deciding whether to move or improve, our calculators quantify the actual payback, resale lift, and total cost of ownership.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
			<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600">Integrated Strategy</p>
			<h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-1000">Tools + Editorial Insights</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
				We connect dynamic calculators with live intelligence articles synced from our central knowledge base, giving you both the high-level strategy and the granular math.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-12">
		<p class="section-eyebrow">Who We Serve</p>
		<div class="mt-4 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
			<article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-1000">Homeowners</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
					Planning high-stakes renovations and looking to maximize equity growth while avoiding costly contractor pitfalls.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-1000">Move vs. Improve Evaluators</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
					Weighing the 5-year financial impact of selling and buying versus expanding their current footprint.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
				<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-1000">System Builders</h3>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
					Optimizing residential energy, smart home ecosystems, preventive maintenance, and utility efficiency.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
